<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Gift Cards | D2Y Mobile Detailing</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Give someone a Mini Valet at their doorstep in Dublin with a personalised D2Y digital gift card.">

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: #101110;
      color: #fff;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    header, main {
      width: min(100% - 40px, 1000px);
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    header {
      padding: 20px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #383b36;
    }

    header a {
      color: #fff;
      text-underline-offset: 4px;
    }

    main {
      display: grid;
      gap: 24px;
      padding: 36px 0 56px;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .gift-card {
      display: grid;
      gap: 24px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .gift-card img {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
    }

    h2 {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }

    p {
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      color: #e1e4dc;
    }

    .buy-button {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 6px;
      padding: 14px 22px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: #a6e63f;
      color: #101110;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .buy-button:hover {
      background: #b8ef63;
    }

    a:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid white;
      outline-offset: 4px;
    }

    @media (min-width: 760px) {
      .gift-card {
        grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
        gap: 40px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <a href="index.html">← Back to D2Y home</a>
  </header>

  <main>
    <h1>Gift Cards</h1>

    <section class="gift-card" aria-labelledby="mini-valet-title">
      <img
        src="mini-valet-gift-card.png"
        alt="Black and lime-green D2Y Mini Valet gift card with space for the recipient’s name and a personal voucher code."
      >

      <div>
        <h2 id="mini-valet-title">Mini Valet Gift Card</h2>

        <p>Give someone a Mini Valet at their doorstep in Dublin.
          They choose the date and we come to them.</p>

        <p>We’ll email the personalised gift card to you, ready to print
          or forward whenever you choose. The price stays off the card
          so you can keep it a surprise.</p>

        <p>To book, the recipient simply sends us their voucher code
          on WhatsApp.</p>

        <a
          class="buy-button"
          href="https://buy.stripe.com/7sY4gs89De7fed0dgw4Rq00"
        >Buy a Gift Card – €70</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
